# RAG Sync

When the user wants to refresh the knowledge base:

1. Ask which domain (or all). Show options with `rag_list_domains`.
2. Call `rag_sync(domain?, force?)`. Use `force: true` for full re-index.
3. Report chunks indexed and domains updated.
